        "runId": "ada-en-0c9cd3aa-38d8-4e78-85c2-7fba7217988e",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "\n\n## Trip Highlights\n\nExplore the Los Roques archipelago, which has more than 350 islands, and see the famous Cayo de Agua sandbar. Visit a sea turtle conservation station and a natural pool with starfish, and go fishing for barracuda. In Canaima, visit the lagoon and the Sapo and Hacha waterfalls. The Orinoco Delta is home to jungle, birds and monkeys, and you may be lucky enough to spot river dolphins.\n"
